&lt;td style="vertical-align:middle;border-top-style:solid;border-top-width:0.75pt;border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-width:0.75pt;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0.75pt;border-right-style:solid;border-right-width:0.75pt;overflow:hidden;" valign="middle"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblC" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:left;padding-left:4.5pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:10pt;"&gt;発行価格　　　328&lt;br/&gt;資本組入額　　164&lt;/p&gt;
